In article <1990Nov27.182626.7441@umiami.ir.miami.edu>,\
 gv9b2c9z@umiami.ir.miami.edu (Ordinary Man) writes...
> How do yo get into the wizard mode, anyway? I am the game administrator here
> on our VAX/VMS but I'm not sure I know how to get into wizard mode. I know that
> "-x" is the explore mode but what's wizard mode.

|$ nethack "-D"
The quotes are needed to preserve case.  This will put you into debug mode
(ie, wizard mode) _if_ you're running from the same VMS username that was
compiled into the game (#define WIZARD in vmsconf.h).  If you're running
under a different username, you'll end up in discover mode instead.

